### ============================================================
###  PLATFORM ACTIVITY – Spanish Poker Dice API
###  Base: http://localhost:8476/api
###
###  Public endpoint – no auth header required.
###  Returns:
###    ongoingGames     – number of games currently in-progress
###    activeUsersWeek  – distinct users who played in the last 7 days
###    recentGames      – last 10 finished games (newest first)
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8476/api


### 1. Get platform activity snapshot
GET {{baseUrl}}/platform/activity
